# The web build Laravel serves (apps/api/public/spa: Docker, CI, Hostinger) reads the content from /api/v1.
# The Vercel test site (--mode static) and the Android app (--mode native) keep the demo data until they switch.
# Public values only: everything here goes into the app's code. See docs/infraestrutura.md.
VITE_DATA_SOURCE=api
# Where "Ajuda-nos a completar" and "Pedir conversa" (mentors) send people: the Kayé mailbox (since 27/11/2026).
VITE_KAYE_EMAIL=ola@kayeangola.com
